{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple passion project from a solo developer. Inspired by air hockey, this game is a 3D top-down game where you control a slippery floating sword guided solely by your mouse. Like air hockey, you and your opponent compete to strike a puck into your opponent's net while defending your own. However, unlike air hockey, this game allows you to glide across the entire arena (not just your side) and strike your opponent's weapon as well as the puck. The swords can be difficult to control, much less the puck, so make sure to guide them with precision using your mouse. <br><br>After 3 minutes, the player with the most goals wins, unless there is a tie, in which case, Sudden Death begins, and the next goal becomes the winning one. Play against your friends or AI in this simple 1v1 air-hockey-style game.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3826850?t=1752346066","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3826850?t=1752346066","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826850/9646cc8621bb868bac093cfc1d1724a96e71e0cc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752346066","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826850/9646cc8621bb868bac093cfc1d1724a96e71e0cc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752346066","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple passion project from a solo developer. Inspired by air hockey, this game is a 3D top-down game where you control a slippery floating sword guided solely by your mouse. Like air hockey, you and your opponent compete to strike a puck into your opponent's net while defending your own. However, unlike air hockey, this game allows you to glide across the entire arena (not just your side) an